I’ve reproduced a false deadline claim from an `echo "deadline start"` command, a runner crash when the progress directory is missing, and missing progress for caller-managed experts. At expiry, the hook also omits the promised worker block and overstates elapsed time for fractional-minute budgets.

The separate CLI checks passed for local time display and waits to 50% and 100%. I’m finishing the review of test assertions and malformed deadline files before writing the findings.
